Convert devicetree bindings for the Motorola CPCAP MFD from TXT to YAML.

Signed-off-by: Svyatoslav Ryhel <clamor95@gmail.com>
Reviewed-by: Rob Herring (Arm) <robh@kernel.org>
---
 .../bindings/mfd/motorola,cpcap.yaml          | 414 ++++++++++++++++++
