This adds support for the ICNA3512 and ICNA3520 DDICs used in the AYN
Odin 2 Portal and for both the AYN Odin 3 and the AYN Thor top panel
respectively.

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
